    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n112414" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φρύγ-ετρον</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῡ]</span>, τό, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φρύγω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>a vessel for roasting barley,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Polyzel.
				6
			</span></i> (troch.(?)): carried by brides in procession, as a symbol of
			household duties, LexSolonisap.<i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				1.246
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>stick to stir barley while roasting,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
		</div>
